{"id":"336078cd2c28561e","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Subtree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-subtree — ZFC Tree8 Subtree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-subtree — ZFC Tree8 Subtree","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-subtree — ZFC Tree8 Subtree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,s,t\\in V\">\\(S,T,s,t\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}subtree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(T,\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T\\mid s\\subseteq t\\}\\bigr)\\land S\\subseteq T\\land\\forall t\\in S\\;\\forall s\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\to s\\in S)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(S,\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in S\\times S\\mid s\\subseteq t\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}subtree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(T,\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T\\mid s\\subseteq t\\}\\bigr)\\land S\\subseteq T\\land\\forall t\\in S\\;\\forall s\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\to s\\in S)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(S,\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in S\\times S\\mid s\\subseteq t\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both trees use their set-sized restricted inclusion orders, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> is explicitly downward closed under predecessors from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>. Merely requiring <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> itself to be a tree would admit subsets that omit mother-tree prefixes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S$ (tree-order predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T,s,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}subtree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(T,\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T\\mid s\\subseteq t\\}\\bigr)\\land S\\subseteq T\\land\\forall t\\in S\\;\\forall s\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\to s\\in S)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(S,\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in S\\times S\\mid s\\subseteq t\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1127,"backlinks":[{"id":"96725962b9ae69ca","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c7287f9e62abafc5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]])"},{"id":"a9550fb0afb52328","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\subseteq V^2$（见 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]）"},{"id":"6f4850acf79db53d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S$（子树谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]）"},{"id":"4658e52eae77575f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S$（子树谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3820","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md|58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d25b709595952a78"]}